---
description: Makes the portable agent templates discoverable to Cursor. Each agent in agents/ can be invoked by name — read that file for its prompt.
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: false
---

This repo's agents are defined in the top-level `agents/` directory. They are portable markdown files — the same files work in Claude Code, Codex, and other tools.

To invoke an agent by name (e.g., `code-reviewer`), read `agents/code-reviewer.md` and use it as the system prompt for that task. The frontmatter `name` and `description` fields identify it; the body is the agent's instructions.

Available agents:

- `agents/code-reviewer.md`
- `agents/security-reviewer.md`
- `agents/unit-test-writer.md`
